# A shield counter (CR 122.1c) replaces a destruction "as the result of an effect": Go for the Throat destroying Captain America,
# Super-Soldier instead removes the counter (the rulings: it is not a regeneration, and he is not tapped), and he stays. It does
# not stop a sacrifice: Innocent Blood (each player sacrifices a creature) takes him on turn 4. The destroy came first and left
# him on the battlefield, untapped, with his counter gone and nothing in Bot1's graveyard.

